flowchart TD
    A([Bug Reported]) --> B[Create Bug]
    B --> C[Assign Bug to Team Member]
    C --> D[Set Status: In Progress]
    D --> E[Developer Investigates]
    E --> F{Bug Fixed?}

    F -- No --> E
    F -- Yes --> G[Set Status: Fixed]
    G --> H[Team Lead Reviews]
    H --> I{Resolution Accepted?}

    I -- Yes --> J[Close Bug]
    I -- No --> K[Reopen Bug]
    K --> D

    J --> L([Bug Resolved])
